msgstr ""

#: lib/potok_ide_web/domain_copy.ex:972
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "A picture a description's template takes from the device is a <Value>value</Value> in the group's chat with its <ValueAttachment>file</ValueAttachment>, so it stays among the group's files. More people see a description than a chat, so the picture's address is signed and needs no login. Deleting that value also removes the picture from the description."
msgstr ""

#: lib/potok_ide_web/domain_copy.ex:970
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "A picture in a description is a file in the chat"
msgstr ""

#: lib/potok_ide_web/domain_copy.ex:956
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "A new <Group>group</Group> can start from a preset: chat, folder, announcements, feed or page. A preset sets what any group can have and nothing remembers it, so all of it can be changed later. Announcements also get a <GroupManifest>manifest</GroupManifest> of their own, in which `everyone` no longer writes. A feed is two groups, one with the Feed app and one below it with FeedCreator, and each keeps its own copy of its app, so a new version reaches only the feeds made after it."
msgstr ""

#: lib/potok_ide_web/domain_copy.ex:954
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "A preset only fills in a new group"
msgstr ""
